e": "com.immblend.ibk-20260211-113101.png", "id": "2366770363823308", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_2366770367156641_5642245502354330804_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W39ggLJD6uAQ7kNvwGmgiiw&_nc_oc=AdqyXu3nc3Ba6sBIjxKHnHAIDRv6clnbo9ZYR6m3XJ5Y-tNtwUltPYZjVmdNSiArguo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0-pJq_TTfv_c8VBNH99bXr4TxbjPm4ILezglBqIfFPsQ&oe=69D65763"}, {"file_name": "com.immblend.ibk-20260211-113139.png", "id": "1219818777012081", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1219818780345414_465358202264979670_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bOZsIfnRgRgQ7kNvwGRWNbv&_nc_oc=AdqA4pPuhU7V7cFdafPAaswzOpnx_pjn3CKCLNzsIqPmxw_Hn6VF8-u2wtDkALOHVF8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2YUj4EAOnx__RowoCdyTlk1xEtBVZLxLM4czfBBWm6Zg&oe=69D66264"}, {"file_name": "com.immblend.ibk-20260211-113000.png", "id": "913445851122525", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_913445854455858_7247830624625226897_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TA5HaUdpdAMQ7kNvwF1veJN&_nc_oc=AdqXLFychOnR7HTLw7dJPY8mvMDwQdGxReWsn80TNs7BIlZdeXpiXUlioPNKu1GB-34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1a98CPL4qvelX6SCzH-6BDJqQAfTJ0n89gimL1YgNzvg&oe=69D65C44"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "IB Kommunikationstrainer AI", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Kommunikationstrainer.ai brings professional communication training into Virtual Reality. The app allows you to experience realistic conversation scenarios with AI-powered avatars and develop strong communication skills in a safe, efficient, and highly practical way.\n\nWhether you want to give constructive feedback, resolve conflicts, handle difficult customer interactions, or present with confidence \u2013 kommunikationstrainer.ai provides an immersive training environment you can access anytime. Each scenario dynamically adapts to your behavior: Avatars respond to tone, wording, and body language, creating a believable and highly interactive learning experience.\n\nIntegrated analytics help identify strengths and improvement areas, making training measurable and development sustainable. Companies and educational institutions use kommunikationstrainer.ai to elevate soft-skill learning and improve communication performance across teams.\n\nFeatures:\n\nRealistic AI avatars for authentic communication practice\n\nScenarios for feedback, leadership, customer dialogue, conflict resolution & more\n\nInstant feedback on communication style, behavior, and impact\n\nRepeatable, safe, and scalable VR training\n\nEnhance your communication skills \u2013 practical, effective, and immersive.\n\nThe AI-powered avatars used in kommunikationstrainer.ai fully comply with Section 6.2 of the Meta Developer Data Use Policy. User interactions are processed exclusively at runtime to enable the training experience. No pers", "short_description": "Kommunikationstrainer.ai is your interactive VR coach for modern communication. Train challenging conversations with realistic AI-driven avatars \u2013 from feedback and conflict management to presentations. Improve your communication skills in a safe and immersive learning environment."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover Landscape_IBK AI_v2 (1).png", "id": "2047425966044794", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_2047425969378127_2416390616945215373_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uhCRbQrWW5cQ7kNvwEzJ-km&_nc_oc=AdrIH7xtyaHEzVpwtuXM2-MXEIPK_tC-ENDAIqnIdWUsJLxCg-Dy7UAApQDhdOfw6e0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2GWaCk8E_O63ediw1tEq3LPN_t4lCn0qJ2m9uZIYyvZw&oe=69D658D8"}, {"file_name": "Logo (Transparent)_IBK AI (1).png", "id": "2026894164772794", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "